{
"markdown": "### SquidGesture Pro\n\n**Pro Gestures with Panels.** A gesture tweak that supports centralizing multiple actions into a single gesture, displayed as an intuitive panel.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://media.havoc.app/666208220cb113e591c7d3e9",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://media.havoc.app/666208290cb113e591c7d54f",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
},
{
"url": "https://media.havoc.app/6662082f0cb113e591c7d677",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 3"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Multiple Triggers:** Bottom edge gestures, status bar gestures (single/double tap, long press, swipes), Dock swipes, and hardware buttons.\n- **Extensive Actions:** System screenshot, Control Center, Notification Center, Spotlight, screen recording, lock screen, VPN toggle, media controls, rotation lock, Shortcuts, app/URL launching, and WeChat/Alipay scanning.\n- **Tweak Integrations:** Seamlessly triggers Snapper 2/3, PullOver Pro, Zetsu, Cardculator, CopyVault, Kayoko, and CopyLog.\n- **Broad Compatibility:** Tested on iPhone 6s through iPhone 14, iPads, and jailbreaks including Dopamine, Taurine, Palera1n, Serotonin, and Roothide.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
